  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>The Free Worlds League's fractious politics have always made centralized BattleMech procurement difficult, pushing the FWLM toward heavy investment in conventional infantry to fill the gaps. Deploying crew-served Thumper artillery pieces, these platoons provide indirect fire support at the battalion and regimental level, lobbing high-explosive rounds onto targets beyond direct line of sight. The Thumper is the lightest tube artillery in common service, valued for its mobility relative to heavier systems.</p>"
